# Print-in-place fit proof: the rotor must be a free captive body, clearing the
# fixed post+cap on every surface. `fitcheck` renders rotor ∩ fixed and must be
# EMPTY (radial bore gap + axial cap/base gaps all clear). `fitcheck_neg` shrinks
# the bore onto the post so it MUST overlap, proving the check can fail.
fitcheck      empty
fitcheck_neg  interferes
